{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <i>Forge Synergy. Shape Fate. Score Big.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rogue-lite match-3 game where every match is a move toward mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine radiant gems with enchanted scrolls, wield artisan tools, and unlock relics to craft powerful scoring engines. Each run offers a fresh bag of modifiers, boons, and build paths\u2014designed for tinkerers, and strategists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddff <i>Match. Modify. Master.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gem Matching, Reinvented</strong>: Score by matching colors, then amplify with scrolls, tools, and relics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scrolls &amp; Tools</strong>: Scrolls boost your score. Tools enhance your gems. Combine them for explosive synergy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relics &amp; Charms</strong>: Level up gem colors for stronger base scores. Purchase charms for permanent run modifiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bag-Building Strategy</strong>: Each gem bag has a unique identity. Level it up to unlock new scrolls and boons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boons &amp; Builds</strong>: Choose your starting boon to define your run\u2014whether you favor precision, chaos, or combo madness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <i>Crafted for Depth</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Scrolls, Tools, Relics, and Charms to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Gem Bags with Unique Modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Boons to shape your strategy from the start</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent progression through scroll unlocks and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel-perfect visuals inspired by magical craftsmanship and real-world tools</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Loss","p